{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach and grab it. Check its properties and perform task, otherwise scan or move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    />\"",
    "BT": {
